Optimizer["**MOO Optimizer**<br/>NSGA2 algorithm<br/>Objectives WIP min Throughput max"]
ProblemClass["**BufferCapacityProblem**<br/>n_var 6<br/>xl {1-10} xu {1-10}<br/>n_replications base_seed n_cores"]
InputVars["**Input Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities<br/>each integer in {1-10}"]
GenOperators["**Genetic Operators**<br/>Integer sampling<br/>SBX crossover PM mutation"]
Population["**Population**<br/>pop size configurable<br/>generates candidate capacities"]
NSGA2Runner["**NSGA2 Runner**<br/>run_nsga2_optimization<br/>calls minimize and evolves population"]
EvaluatorPool["**Evaluator Pool**<br/>multiprocessing Pool<br/>parallel evaluate_single_individual"]
MPConfig["**Multiprocessing Config**<br/>n_cores configurable<br/>spawn start method"]
EvalFunction["**evaluate_single_individual**<br/>maps candidate to repeated simulations<br/>returns avg WIP and negative avg Throughput"]
SimulationRunner["**Simulation Runner**<br/>run_simulation function<br/>warmup measure phases"]
PartGenerator["**Part Generator**<br/>generates parts every second into raw input"]
DelayBufferClass["**DelayBuffer**<br/>attributes cap delay store tokens<br/>methods put get free_capacity in_transit_count"]
MachineClass["**Machine**<br/>attributes process_time availability mttr<br/>working_power waiting_power capacity<br/>methods run breakdown_cycle waiting_energy_consumption working_energy_consumption<br/>runtime stats working_time blocked_time wait_input_time processed_count"]
SimulationOutputs["**Simulation Results**<br/>throughput WIP produced_parts machine_energy"]
Aggregator["**Objective Aggregator**<br/>averages over replications<br/>produces two objectives WIP and negative Throughput"]
CSVExport["**Results Exporter**<br/>export_history_to_csv<br/>writes CSV to results folder"]
ManagerView["**Production Manager View**<br/>Pareto front of tradeoffs<br/>select candidate capacity configurations"]

